    ip addresses: bound suggestion capability discovery
    
    Keep one twelve-second caller budget across shared capability discovery and
    the address request. Abort-aware waits settle stalled callers and prevent
    late requests or rows while preserving shared metadata for other queries.
    
    Retain old-API support, progressive loading, retries and the separate
    manual-filter list.
